      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEST END BOY (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.63) at this track behind Minter Delicious in a T3 Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can go on with it. BAMBI'S PRIDE (4) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the money last time though when third (22.71) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Hard to beat again. MUSTANG SABRINA (8) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Maiden winner three back (20.36) at Traralgon over 350m. Can feature with the right run. BITTY BUT (7) must be included in calculations.",
